    {
      "number": "956",
      "text": "956. \u89e3\u65b9\u7a0b\uff1a\n1) $2\\frac{1}{3}k=4\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot1\\frac{1}{9}$\uff1b\n2) $8\\frac{1}{2}m=3\\frac{2}{3}\\cdot1\\frac{1}{11}$\uff1b\n3) $y:\\frac{4}{5}=3\\frac{1}{8}:1\\frac{1}{4}$\uff1b\n4) $x:\\frac{3}{14}=3\\frac{1}{9}:\\frac{4}{9}$.",
